## Spec: Video tagger

### Route
- `/tagger` on root, unlinked from UI
- Component: TaggerView

### Behavior
1. Dropdown lists all VIDEO_DECK_IDS with deck names
2. Select loads video + moves; timestamps init as equal slices on loadedmetadata
3. HTML5 video with controls; timeline playhead follows timeupdate
4. One draggable dot per move; click move selects + seeks; drag sets timestamp
5. JSON `{ deckId, timestamps }` at bottom updates live; click copies to clipboard

### Out of scope
DB, train/review consumption